5, "raw_content": "Finishing up our Costco run on Grant St. in Tucson Wednesday, and while getting ready to leave I noticed an elderly couple at a cafe table.  The man, looked like he had been rode hard and put away wet, probably been through some shit in his life including a few foreign wars...He had on an old plain white tee, and blue jeans, and an old and well worn MAKE AMERICA GREAT AGAIN baseball cap on his head.  I moved closer to him and got his attention, and said, \"We LOVE your hat! Wear it proudly!\" He seemed a little taken aback, and though I didn't notice, my wife said other people were sneering at us and him while we interacted.  Right before I started to turn and walk away it was obvious that he was choking up that I said that to him.  My wife said she thought he was about to cry.  I hope he has a wonderful remainder of his life, and I hope we can fix this shit for people like him who have suffered through life way more than my whiny ass has. ", "author": "BahamaDon", "created": 1786133312534, "profile_picture": "tTItVoXTx2D5", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Southernwhitebread2", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Beautiful old man at Tucson Costco, with MAGA hat on.", "last_comment_created": 1786134213664, "content": "<p>Finishing up our Costco run on Grant St. in Tucson Wednesday, and while getting ready to leave I noticed an elderly couple at a cafe table.  The man, looked like he had been rode hard and put away wet, probably been through some shit in his life including a few foreign wars...He had on an old plain white tee, and blue jeans, and an old and well worn MAKE AMERICA GREAT AGAIN baseball cap on his head.  I moved closer to him and got his attention, and said, &quot;We LOVE your hat! Wear it proudly!&quot; He seemed a little taken aback, and though I didn't notice, my wife said other people were sneering at us and him while we interacted.  Right before I started to turn and walk away it was obvious that he was choking up that I said that to him.  My wife said she thought he was about to cry.  I hope he has a wonderful remainder of his life, and I hope we can fix this shit for people like him who have suffered through life way more than my whiny ass has.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 22, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "SAVE AMERICA", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATC9TGpiF", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 100, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8768013, "raw_content": "", "author": "Sunnybats2", "created": 1786102724311, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "CaptainQuip", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.patriots.win", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATC9TGpiF.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.patriots.win/post/FHhfnpdOTwmZ.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/7acfrtZrCXKFLZNu.jpeg", "width": 483, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 768}], "blurhash": "UXQm9lxD-;xu~pM|MxRj01xXtRof-:NHV?WB", "full_resolution": [1717, 1080]}, "title": "Madison Cawthorn: \u201cCongress is filled with a punch of pervs and sex addicts.\u201d \r\nChuck Edwards: \u201cMadison Cawthorn is unfit to hold office.\u201d \r\nMadison Cawthorn: -Loses his seat to Chuck- \r\nChuck Edwards: